#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000001
msgid ""
"A non-lethal weapon that delivers a 1.5 million volt electric shock to the target, overloading their motor neurons and rendering them unable to move. Shocking the target long enough will knock them unconscious.\n"
"\n"
"By making use of conducting materials (water, metal), it can be used to shock more distant targets as well.\n"
"\n"
"Charging the rod takes a short while, so it cannot be used multiple times in a row. Keep this in mind when facing multiple enemies.\n"
"\n"
"Useful when going for a no-kill completion, or when ammo is running short for your other weapons."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000002
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000003
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000004
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000005
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000006
msgid ""
"A special handgun developed by the U.S. Navy for its Special Forces units. It is furnished with a slide lock mechanism to maximize the noise-canceling effect when equipped with a suppressor. For this reason, it is limited to single-shot manual fire.\n"
"\n"
"For ammo, the Mod 0 uses a special tranquilizer round that puts enemies to sleep. A good partner to have at your side when going for a no-kill completion."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000007
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000008
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000009
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000a
msgid ""
"A special pistol developed by technical genius Sigint. Equipped with a built-in suppressor so that the suppression effect never wears off.\n"
"\n"
"Fires \"LIFE Recovery Rounds\" that restore the LIFE of the target. As such, its use in solo missions is rather limited; its real value is in CO-OPS when fighting alongside teammates."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000b
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000c
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000d
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000e
msgid ""
"A special pistol developed by technical genius Sigint. Equipped with a built-in suppressor so that the suppression effect never wears off.\n"
"\n"
"Fires \"PSYCHE Recovery Rounds\" that restore the PSYCHE of the target. As such, its use in solo missions is rather limited; its real value is in CO-OPS when fighting alongside teammates."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00000f
msgid ""
"The primary automatic pistol of the U.S. military. Uses large-caliber .45 ammunition. It is easy to modify, and has thus become popular as a base for custom guns.\n"
"\n"
"The .45 ammo gives it high stopping power, making it an effective tool for halting enemy advances."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000010
msgid ""
"The primary automatic pistol of the U.S. military. Uses large-caliber .45 ammunition. It is easy to modify, and has thus become popular as a base for custom guns.\n"
"\n"
"The .45 ammo gives it high stopping power, making it an effective tool for halting enemy advances.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000011
msgid ""
"A custom model of the M1911A1, incorporating high-precision parts for improved all-around performance.\n"
"\n"
"The improved firing precision allows users to pinpoint enemies' vital areas, increasing the chances of dealing heavy damage."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000012
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000013
msgid ""
"A custom model of the M1911A1, incorporating high-precision parts for improved all-around performance.\n"
"\n"
"The improved firing precision allows users to pinpoint enemies' vital areas, increasing the chances of dealing heavy damage.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000014
msgid ""
"The primary automatic pistol of the Soviet military and other Warsaw Pact forces. The gun itself is extremely lightweight, and the ammo, while medium in caliber, is more than powerful enough in practice.\n"
"\n"
"The PM is easy to handle and allows the user to move freely, reducing the risk of alerting the enemy. A good weapon for a sneaking mission."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000015
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000016
msgid ""
"A variation on the PM with a built-in suppressor, meaning the suppression effect never wears off.\n"
"\n"
"The PB's shots are just as powerful as the PM's with less risk of being heard, making this an even better weapon for a sneaking mission."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000017
msgid ""
"The world's premiere combat revolver, a product of the U.S.A. It combines smooth action with high precision and dependability, earning it a large fan base among combat shooters.\n"
"\n"
"The M19 uses powerful .357 Magnum rounds, which makes for high recoil but gives it enough force to knock enemies off their feet. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000018
msgid ""
"The world's premiere combat revolver, a product of the U.S.A. It combines smooth action with high precision and dependability, earning it a large fan base among combat shooters.\n"
"\n"
"The M19 uses powerful .357 Magnum rounds, which means high recoil but enough force to knock enemies off their feet.\n"
"\n"
"The barrel has been extended for improved accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000019
msgid ""
"The world's premiere combat revolver, a product of the U.S.A. It combines smooth action with high precision and dependability, earning it a large fan base among combat shooters.\n"
"\n"
"The M19 uses powerful .357 Magnum rounds, which means high recoil but enough force to knock enemies off their feet.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The addition of a laser sight allows for easier targeting."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001a
msgid ""
"A combat pistol modified to launch small grenades. Based on a flare gun used by the German Army during the Second World War.\n"
"\n"
"Small enough to wield with one hand and holding only a single shot, the Kampfpistole may look somewhat wimpy, but it has enough power to get the job done. It can even hold its own against armored combat vehicles."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001b
msgid ""
"A combat pistol modified to launch small grenades. Based on a flare gun used by the German army during the Second World War.\n"
"\n"
"Small enough to wield with one hand and holding only a single shot, the Kampfpistole may look somewhat wimpy, but it has enough power to get the job done. It can even hold its own against armored combat vehicles.\n"
"\n"
"A rifle stock has been added for improved accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001c
msgid ""
"An automatic pistol developed by the German Empire during the First World War. Large numbers were produced for use in Germany as well as for overseas export, most notably to China, where it became the favored weapon of bandit gangs.\n"
"\n"
"The C96 handles much like an extremely compact carbine rifle; its ammo produces strong recoil but boasts impressive stopping power. All in all, a pistol best suited to experienced, confident players."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001d
msgid ""
"An automatic pistol developed by the German Empire during the First World War. Large numbers were produced for use in Germany as well as for overseas export, most notably to China, where it became the favored weapon of bandit gangs.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to enable full-auto fire. It is difficult to control, but very powerful when mastered.  "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001e
msgid ""
"An automatic pistol developed by the German Empire during the First World War. Large numbers were produced for use in Germany as well as for overseas export, most notably to China, where it became the favored weapon of bandit gangs.\n"
"\n"
"This is a full-auto fire model - difficult to control, but very powerful when mastered.  \n"
"\n"
"It has been modified to accommodate larger magazines, providing it with even greater firepower."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00001f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000020
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000021
msgid ""
"This pistol, a unique R&D Team creation, is used when requesting support supplies from Mother Base. It fires a marker that indicates the supply drop location.\n"
"\n"
"Useful in missions where supplies are difficult to procure on site."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000022
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000023
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000024
msgid ""
"This pistol, a unique R&D Team creation, is used when requesting support strikes from Mother Base. It fires a marker that indicates the strike location.\n"
"\n"
"Use it to gain the upper hand in combat by taking advantage of Mother Base's firepower."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000025
msgid ""
"A delicious fruit (in botanical terms, technically a vegetable) from the plantations of Costa Rica. Low in calories and high in vitamins, minerals, and dietary fiber, it is an excellent source of nutrition. Many people know the banana chiefly as a snack or dessert or as an ingredient in baked goods, but in some countries and regions it is a staple food.\n"
"\n"
"Its shape vaguely resembles that of a gun. With a bit of skill, you could even use it to hold someone up...maybe."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000029
msgid ""
"A double-barreled shotgun used for hunting. The design is outdated and it only holds two shells at a time, but its high reliability has enabled it to withstand the test of time.\n"
"\n"
"Although the shells are powerful enough to send enemies flying with a close-range hit, it only has the range of a pistol. Best suited to players who excel in close-quarters fighting."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002a
msgid ""
"A double-barreled shotgun used for hunting. The design is outdated and it only holds two shells at a time, but its high reliability has enabled it to withstand the test of time.\n"
"\n"
"The barrel has been sawed off short for easier handling. This modification also increases the effective range of AUTO AIM and makes the gun an even better match for close-quarters combat."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002b
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002c
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002d
msgid ""
"A double-barreled shotgun used for hunting. The design is outdated and it only holds two shells at a time, but its high reliability has enabled it to withstand the test of time.\n"
"\n"
"Modifications to the chamber have made it easier to load, reducing reload time and making the gun even more perfect for close-quarters combat."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002e
msgid ""
"A sawed-off, double-barreled shotgun modified to fire special non-lethal rubber slugs.\n"
"\n"
"A must-have for players going for a no-kill completion."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00002f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000030
msgid ""
"A sawed-off, double-barreled shotgun modified to fire special non-lethal rubber slugs.\n"
"\n"
"The chamber has been modified for easier loading and shorter reload time."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000031
msgid ""
"A pump-action shotgun. Shells are loaded and ejected through the same opening. This makes the gun sturdier by reducing the number of apertures while also allowing for a more slender and hence lighter frame - almost a kilogram lighter than similar products of the same generation. It is popular among military, law enforcement, and civilian users alike.\n"
"\n"
"While not big on ammo capacity, it packs plenty of firepower - good for those unexpected close encounters."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000032
msgid ""
"A pump-action shotgun. Shells are loaded and ejected through the same opening. This makes the gun sturdier by reducing the number of apertures while also allowing for a more slender and hence lighter frame - almost a kilogram lighter than similar products of the same generation. It is popular among military, law enforcement, and civilian users alike.\n"
"\n"
"The tube magazine has been extended to increase its ammo capacity."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000033
