"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000035
msgid ""
"A pump-action shotgun. Shells are loaded and ejected through the same opening. This makes the gun sturdier by reducing the number of apertures while also allowing for a more slender and hence lighter frame - almost a kilogram lighter than similar products of the same generation. It is popular among military, law enforcement, and civilian users alike.\n"
"\n"
"Fitted with a rifle stock for improved firing precision."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000036
msgid ""
"A pump-action shotgun. Shells are loaded and ejected through the same opening. This makes the gun sturdier by reducing the number of apertures while also allowing for a more slender and hence lighter frame - almost a kilogram lighter than similar products of the same generation. It is popular among military, law enforcement, and civilian users alike.\n"
"\n"
"Fitted with a rifle stock and a scope and adapted to fire slugs. These modifications have improved its long-range firing precision to the point where it can even be used as a substitute for a sniper rifle in some conditions."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000037
msgid ""
"An automatic combat shotgun designed with versatility in mind. Distinguished by its solid frame and high-speed semi-auto fire.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing can match its blistering firepower in a close-range battle; on the down side, its sheer weight encumbers the user and makes it slow and unwieldy to handle. In the hands of a skilled and confident user, the SPAS is truly a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000038
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000039
msgid ""
"An automatic combat shotgun designed with versatility in mind. Distinguished by its solid frame and high-speed semi-auto fire.\n"
"\n"
"The tube magazine has been extended to increase its ammo capacity.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing can match its blistering firepower in a close-range battle; on the down side, its sheer weight encumbers the user and makes it slow and unwieldy to handle. In the hands of a skilled and confident user, the SPAS is truly a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00003a
msgid ""
"A fully automatic shotgun, created as a prototype to explore the potential of next-generation personal close-combat weapons. It fires a specially designed 12-gauge shell that allows for both high ammo capacity and a high rate of fire.\n"
"\n"
"This is the final word in shotguns, a gale-force barrage of lead in a compact package. If you're looking for maximum attack power at point-blank range, look no further - this is the weapon for you."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00003d
msgid ""
"One of the very first submachine guns ever produced. In its long and storied history, it has seen use by everyone from armies and police forces to gangsters, guerrillas and Chinese warlords. \n"
"\n"
"It uses the same large-caliber ammo as the M1911. While its rate of fire is nothing spectacular, it makes each shot count with devastating firepower.\n"
"\n"
"The M1928A1's elegant design makes it easy to handle, in effect helping to improve its accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"However, it is unusually heavy for a submachine gun and takes two hands to wield properly; thus, it cannot be used with a shield."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00003e
msgid ""
"One of the very first submachine guns ever produced. In its long and storied history, it has seen use by everyone from armies and police forces to gangsters, guerrillas and Chinese warlords. \n"
"\n"
"It uses the same large-caliber ammo as the M1911. While its rate of fire is nothing spectacular, it makes each shot count with devastating firepower.\n"
"\n"
"The M1928A1's elegant design makes it easy to handle, in effect helping to improve its accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"However, it is unusually heavy for a submachine gun and takes two hands to wield properly; thus, it cannot be used with a shield.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified with an added grip, giving it improved control and accuracy during sustained fire."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00003f
msgid ""
"One of the very first submachine guns ever produced. In its long and storied history, it has seen use by everyone from armies and police forces to gangsters, guerrillas and Chinese warlords. \n"
"\n"
"It uses the same large-caliber ammo as the M1911. While its rate of fire is nothing spectacular, it makes each shot count with devastating firepower.\n"
"\n"
"The M1928A1's elegant design makes it easy to handle, in effect helping to improve its accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"However, it is unusually heavy for a submachine gun and takes two hands to wield properly; thus, it cannot be used with a shield.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to accommodate a drum magazine, significantly boosting its ammo capacity. Hence, it does not need to be reloaded as often, giving it a tactical advantage over models that use standard magazines."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000040
msgid ""
"A miniature light submachine gun developed for Special Forces use, notable for its extremely compact, highly portable design.\n"
"\n"
"The M10's extremely high rate of fire allows the user to pelt the target with a barrage of well-placed shots, giving it impressive stopping power. This power comes at the expense of accuracy, however, as the gun's small size is ill-balanced against its high recoil.\n"
"\n"
"It takes a great deal of practice to bring out this submachine gun's full capabilities; the best approach is to keep using it until you are thoroughly familiar with how it handles. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000041
msgid ""
"A miniature light machine gun developed for Special Forces use, notable for its extremely compact, highly portable design.\n"
"\n"
"The M10's extremely high rate of fire allows the user to pelt the target with a barrage of well-placed shots, giving it impressive stopping power. This power comes at the expense of accuracy, however, as the gun's small size is ill-balanced against its high recoil.\n"
"\n"
"It takes a great deal of practice to bring out this submachine gun's full capabilities; the best approach is to keep using it until you are thoroughly familiar with how it handles. \n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000042
msgid ""
"A miniature light machine gun developed for Special Forces use, notable for its extremely compact, highly portable design.\n"
"\n"
"The M10's extremely high rate of fire allows the user to pelt the target with a barrage of well-placed shots, giving it impressive stopping power. This power comes at the expense of accuracy, however, as the gun's small size is ill-balanced against its high recoil.\n"
"\n"
"It takes a great deal of practice to bring out this submachine gun's full capabilities; the best approach is to keep using it until you are thoroughly familiar with how it handles. \n"
"\n"
"This model is fitted with a barrel jacket, slightly increasing the weight and shifting the center of gravity forward. The effect is to reduce muzzle jump, improving the gun's firing accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000043
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5A2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000044
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5A2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000045
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"This model features a built-in suppressor, so the suppression effect never wears off.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5SD2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000046
msgid ""
"A Czechoslovakia-made submachine gun developed as a self-defense weapon for vehicle crews. Its ultra-compact design is tailored for use in cramped vehicle compartments.\n"
"\n"
"The Uz61's small frame makes it incredibly easy to handle and a wide effective AUTO AIM range. While it boasts low recoil and a relatively high rate of fire, its ammunition is rather underpowered, requiring multiple shots and a careful aim to be effective."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000047
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000048
msgid ""
"A Czechoslovakia-made submachine gun developed as a self-defense weapon for vehicle crews. Its ultra-compact design is tailored for use in cramped vehicle compartments.\n"
"\n"
"The Uz61's small frame makes it incredibly easy to handle and gives it a wide AUTO AIM range. While it boasts low recoil and a relatively high rate of fire, its ammunition is rather underpowered, requiring multiple shots and a careful aim to be effective.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00004c
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00004d
msgid ""
"An advanced, lightweight assault rifle developed by the U.S. Army in a departure from the traditional large-caliber infantry rifle. Also known as the \"black rifle\" due to the color of its frame, which is largely made of plastic. Notable for its use in the Vietnam War, where it made a name for itself with its superior performance.\n"
"\n"
"The M16A1 uses small-caliber, low-recoil ammunition, and as a result its firing accuracy is truly impressive."
msgstr ""

