"\n"
"The M16A1 uses small-caliber, low-recoil ammunition, and as a result its firing accuracy is truly impressive.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified with an extra underbarrel shotgun, greatly increasing its firepower and making it an effective weapon against both close- and long-range targets."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000050
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005b
msgid ""
"The assault pistol that The Boss, the Mother of Special Forces and mentor of Naked Snake, carried with her into her final battle. It is essentially a truncated M16 that has been fully revamped with custom parts.\n"
"\n"
"Because the Patriot fires rifle rounds from a pistol-sized frame, it is extremely difficult to control, bucking like a wild bronco in the user's hand.\n"
"\n"
"It never runs out of bullets - perhaps, as some say, because The Boss left a piece of herself inside it."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000051
msgid ""
