"\n"
"This model has been modified with an extra underbarrel shotgun, greatly increasing its firepower and making it an effective weapon against both close- and long-range targets.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The addition of a laser sight allows for easier targeting."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000053
msgid ""
