#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005c
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. "
msgstr ""

